== Disclaimer ==
The Commons SVG Checker relies on third party services. By executing a check your browser sends the usual information attached to HTTP-requests (IP-address, User Agent, Timestamp) to a web service located at [https://tools.wmflabs.org/convert/ https://tools.wmflabs.org/convert/]. The service is maintained by [[User:Rillke|Rillke]], and server by the Wikimedia Foundation. Rillke does not track these requests but they may show up (anonymized) in the error logs.

